      "side": 1,
      "message": "Caveh -\nFor Brya, is there a use case for a shipping device that won\u0027t have contiguous ports?  Or is this something only needed by developers for testing?\n\nIf non-contiguous ports is needed.  It would be better to create an API pair usb_pd_disable_port() and usb_pd_enable_port().  Then usb_common.c could store a static mask of the enabled ports.",
      "parentUuid": "0009eae6_6d992f99",
      "revId": "a3596c03acff18bba257ce112dadd81e3850a105",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
